.TH EZDXF\-STRIP "1" "May 2024" "" "User Commands"
.B ezdxf\ strip
\(en strip comments and \fBTHUMBNAILIMAGE\fR section from DXF files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ezdxf\ strip
.RB [ \-h ]
.RB [ \-b ]
.RB [ \-t ]
.RB [ \-\-handles ]
.RB [ \-v ]
.RI [ FILE ]
.RI [ FILE ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Strip comment tags (group code 999) from ASCII DXF files
and can remove the
.B THUMBNAILIMAGE
section.
Binary DXF files are not supported.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS "POSITIONAL\ ARGUMENTS"
.TP
.I FILE
DXF file to process, wildcards
.B *
and
.B ?
are supported
.SS "OPTIONAL\ ARGUMENTS"
.TP
.B \-h\fR,\ \fB\-\-help
show a help message and exit
.TP
.B \-b\fR,\ \fB\-\-backup
make a backup copy with extension
.B .bak
from the DXF file, overwrites existing backup files
.TP
.B \-t\fR,\ \fB\-\-thumbnail
strip
.B THUMBNAILIMAGE
section
.TP
.B \-\-handles
remove handles from DXF R12 or older files
.TP
.B \-v\fR,\ \fB\-\-verbose
give more output
.SH ENVIRONMENT
See
.BR ezdxf (1).
.SH FILES
See
.BR ezdxf (1).
.SH "SEE\ ALSO"
.BR ezdxf (1)
.P
